Read `docs/workout-player-spec.md` before changing the player.

- Never implement the timer by only decrementing state once per second.
- Calculate remaining time from a deadline and the current clock.
- Pause stores a stable remaining duration; resume creates a new deadline.
- The Previous control restarts the current element on first press and moves to the previous element on a second quick press.
- Do not add a separate Repeat Round button.
- Next moves forward with one press and records skipped or partial execution correctly.
- ±15 seconds changes the active countdown and may extend beyond the original plan where allowed.
- Rating during rest is optional and never pauses the countdown.
- Show the next element; do not repeat the just-finished exercise in the rest summary.
- Use gong audio for transitions and Screen Wake Lock while active.
- The player must tolerate visibility changes and allow recovery after refresh.
